# post_r6.probe — P4/R6 (PLAN-RENDER): the directed light cone + vignette over a
# uniform gray-128 scene (src/postprobe.loft) — the falloff measured with zero
# scene interference. Expected values generated by
# tools/blueprints/light_cone.py (the shader's exact formula):
#   anchor full-lit; ahead150 (117) > behind150 (73) = the forward-pointed lamp;
#   corner = the light floor x vignette; the ahead ray monotonically dims.

image /tmp/probe_post.png

probe anchor 400 420 127 127 127 tol 3
probe ahead150 400 270 117 117 117 tol 3
probe behind150 400 570 73 73 73 tol 3
probe corner 40 40 38 38 38 tol 3
ramp ahead_ray 400 420 400 80 dec samples 12 tol 2
